    <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or circumvent security measures</li>
    <li>Use the app to harass, defraud, or harm other users</li>
    <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to other users' data</li>
    <li>Use automated tools (bots, scrapers) to access the service</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Your Data and Content</h2>
  <p>
    You retain ownership of all data you enter into SliceBill (expense names, amounts, member names). By using the service, you grant DARDAN SP. Z O.O. a limited license to store and process this data solely to provide the SliceBill service.
  </p>
